# Build context for deploy/nitro/Dockerfile.enclave (BuildKit reads this file
# instead of the root .dockerignore): the workspace manifests, crates/,
# skill/ and the enclave's start script, nothing else. Anything else in the
# context could only make two builds of one commit differ.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!skill/
!deploy/nitro/enclave-start.sh
crates/**/target/
